VALUES (30768, 'tt0330152', NULL, 'The Christmas Shoes', 'The Christmas Shoes', 'movie', 2002, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uDuFMPcx64Tbd46CvPLjsxWoJrw.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2exYPi3NK8blXSdhPt1krr82FUJ.jpg', 'Two separate stories mesh - in the first, a young music teacher, Maggie Andrews, begins dying of a heart condition and her son Nathan tries to get a pair of Christmas shoes for her before she dies. In the second, lawyer Robert Layton and his wife Kate are slowly drifting apart and the matter comes to a head during Christmas when Kate takes over for Maggie for the school choir.', NULL, NULL, 1.6703, 6.842, 0, 1.01, '2026-11-26 23:30:20', '2026-11-26 23:30:20')
