VALUES (34723, 'tt0106223', NULL, 'The Adventures of Huck Finn', 'The Adventures of Huck Finn', 'movie', 1993, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8VpQZ43hdaTUmkMoe2CnED1Y2fS.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/19RoH2VH3IjgUFYc2oUZFJxLQ97.jpg', 'Mischievous Huck Finn is unnerved when his father, reemerging after years away, kidnaps him in an attempt to take away a $600 inheritance from his late mother. Fearing for his life, Huck fakes his own death and escapes. He soon runs into his friend, Jim, a slave fleeing his master. Together, the pair embarks on a raft journey down the Mississippi River, staying ahead of pursuers who blame the slave for Huck''s alleged murder.', NULL, NULL, 2.5834, 6.2, 0, 1.08, '2026-11-26 23:30:20', '2026-11-26 23:30:20')
