VALUES (23030, 'tt0060121', NULL, 'Arabesque', 'Arabesque', 'movie', 1966, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ufQBXrETmVizoVaoYKAmjArRTyr.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tCfdA5LRFiKIiz6Og6I3DvEFJla.jpg', 'When a plot against a prominent Middle Eastern politician is uncovered, David Pollock, a professor of ancient hieroglyphics at Oxford University, is recruited to help expose the scheme. Pollock must find information believed to be in hieroglyphic code and must also contend with a mysterious man called Beshraavi. Meanwhile, Beshraavi''s lover, Yasmin Azir, seems willing to aid Pollock -- but is she really on his side?', NULL, NULL, 2.3615, 6.3, 0, 2.12, '2026-07-31 03:33:23', '2026-11-26 23:30:20')
