VALUES (1218925, 'tt30472557', NULL, 'Chainsaw Man - The Movie: Reze Arc', '劇場版 チェンソーマン レゼ篇', 'movie', 2025, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i69jR67amezdJ3sx6OOvOGn7HAR.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pQBjQCtldmru3EhWVH83qKfnvPL.jpg', 'In a world where devils are born from humanity’s fears, Denji has only ever dreamed of living a simple life, eating good food, finding happiness, and experiencing the warmth of being loved. Then, one rainy afternoon, fate leads him to Reze, a mysterious girl working at a small café. With her disarming smile, playful charm, and unexpected kindness, she offers Denji something he has rarely known—a glimpse of an ordinary life beyond bloodshed and chaos.', NULL, NULL, 34.244, 8.544, 0, 8.416, '2026-08-06 03:21:21', '2026-11-26 23:30:20')
