VALUES (284689, 'tt1441953', NULL, 'Testament of Youth', 'Testament of Youth', 'movie', 2015, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a6kFsaDCulCLfYHmKLDKTYaddM4.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jD0mmfqPRpvJUaPdpLl1vMj38CA.jpg', 'Testament of Youth is a powerful story of love, war and remembrance, based on the First World War memoir by Vera Brittain, which has become the classic testimony of that war from a woman’s point of view. A searing journey from youthful hopes and dreams to the edge of despair and back again, it’s a film about young love, the futility of war and how to make sense of the darkest times.', NULL, NULL, 2.1191, 7.243, 0, 3.01333333333333319e+00, '2026-08-10 02:34:01', '2026-11-26 23:30:20')
